format rankings-v1
# rankings — the 27-slot emphasis rota over Grain's living corpus.
#
# Round N tends rankings[N mod 27]: one living target gets emphasis attention that
# round (freshen it, run its witness, apply its discipline, note its drift). One full
# revolution is 27 rounds. Generalizes the elder 16-slot priority cycle
# (tools/gen/season/recursion_block.brix) from practices to the living documents, and
# counts 27 to rhyme with the d27 council (the outfit-seats / nakshatras).
#
# 256 rounds per season mod 27 completes ~9.48 revolutions, so the emphasis drifts
# across the calendar rather than aligning to journey/equinox edges — every ranking
# is tended regardless of where it falls. Four areas, balanced.
stamp 20260810.213133
seat Keaton's word 20260810
cycle 27

